[CHANGE] benchmark_2/parts/ring_buffer/lib/ring_buffer_impl.py: Implement concrete RingBuffer singleton: deque(maxlen=10) backing state, capacity/size/is_empty/is_full getters, push with oldest-item eviction returning evicted value, pop raising BufferEmptyError when empty, clear, and FIFO snapshot_items; fix pretense import path and register in system tier.
[CHANGE] benchmark_2/parts/ring_buffer/pretense/ring_buffer_pretense.py: Model bounded ring buffer state (capacity 10, FIFO items) with 1:1 transitions for push (eviction on saturation), pop (gated non-empty precondition), clear, snapshot_items, and capacity/size/is_empty/is_full property queries using make_return_value pivots; expose FakeRingBuffer and FakeRingBufferFuzzTest.
[CHANGE] benchmark_2/parts/ring_buffer/pretense/ring_buffer_impl_pretense.py: Implement RingBufferImplPseudoStateMachine inheriting the interface state machine with call_target pivots and real SUT postcondition asserts (size/eviction/clear/snapshot/property parity) for all 8 transitions; replace scaffold placeholder with granular TestRingBufferImplReal scenarios driving self.checked for push, eviction at capacity, FIFO pop, clear, snapshot, capacity, and empty-flag coverage; keep RingBufferFuzzTest on the real SUT factory.
